    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9676" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντεπι-γράφω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>write</i> something <i>instead,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλὰ ἐπιγράμματα ἀνελὼν ἀσεβῆ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					22.72
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εσθαι ἐπὶ τὸ νίκημα</span>
			<i>put their own</i> names <i>instead of the other party to</i>
			the victory, i.e. <i>claim</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				18.34.2
			</span></i>.</div>
